<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33771" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like a wound</i> or
				<i>sore, ulcerated</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					3.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1359
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνῆμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					895a31
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>causing</i> or <i>accompanied by soreness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					7.179
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					7.179
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap. eund.<i><span class="en">
				8.106
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονιορτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Ost.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>irritable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				32.11.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.454b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
